torname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) & =-2\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our general solution is $y=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.$ To find a particular solution, we substitute the condition $f(0)=-1$ into our solution and obtain a value for $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡0+C \\\\ -1 & =-2(0)+C \\\\ C & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\nf(x)=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1.\n$$" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289790 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289791 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289792 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289793 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186289794 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1041 "selection" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1104 #edb/ref 17592186289791 13194139534466 true] [17592186289789 1110 #uuid "f9fb5778-ba1b-563c-934c-4d2eafdbb97b" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289790 1034 "f(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289790 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534466 true] [17592186289790 1111 #uuid "d14e0df1-3bb8-5197-b25c-bc87e8eef3d3" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289791 1034 "f(x)=-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289791 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534466 true] [17592186289791 1111 #uuid "4f766d19-73fe-5c00-851c-def3a95b1697" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289792 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-1" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534466 true] [17592186289792 1111 #uuid "b25c8c97-b577-5dfa-9d6d-9b976fd446bd" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289793 1034 "f(x)=-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+1" 13194139534466 true] [17592186289793 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534466 true] [17592186289793 1111 #uu